Subject: [PATCH 237/307] !F (Sandbox) Add terrain.reposition_vegetation.

Re-sample painted vegetation from live engine terrain inside a requested box.
Re-register affected instances so ordinary vegetation, auto-merged meshes and
ground decals follow terrain changed outside the editor heightmap.
---
