 .../EditorQt/Terrain/TerrainEditor.cpp        |  3 +
 .../EditorQt/Vegetation/VegetationMap.cpp     | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../EditorQt/Vegetation/VegetationMap.h       | 10 +++
 4 files changed, 138 insertions(+)

